  "description": "NEW TO THE MARKET\n\nCLOWERHILL, BALLINROBE, CO. MAYO\nF31 KN81\n\nFULLY RESTORED 3-BEDROOM FARMHOUSE\nON c.1 ACRE MATURE SITE\n\nASKING PRICE: €240,000 O.N.O.\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers are delighted to present this beautifully restored three-bedroom farmhouse, standing on an attractive c.1 acre mature site at Clowerhill, approximately two miles from Ballinrobe town.\n\nSituated in the heart of South Mayo's Lake District, this charming traditional residence has been extensively restored and is presented in turnkey condition.\n\nACCOMMODATION\n\nGROUND FLOOR\n\n• Front porch\n• Day/living room with Stanley range\n• Sitting room with open fireplace\n• Modern fitted kitchen with units and appliances\n• Utility kitchen with fitted units\n\nFIRST FLOOR\n\n• Landing\n• Three double bedrooms\n• Modern bathroom\n\nGENERAL FEATURES\n\nThe residence benefits from oil-fired central heating, double glazing, insulation, electricity, telephone and broadband availability.\n\nThe property combines the character of a traditional farmhouse with the comfort of a substantially upgraded home and is ready for immediate occupation.\n\nOUTSIDE\n\nThe residence stands on approximately one acre with mature surroundings and associated outbuildings, providing excellent outdoor space in an attractive countryside setting.\n\nLOCATION\n\nClowerhill is situated approximately two miles from Ballinrobe town, providing convenient access to shops, schools, sporting facilities and everyday amenities.\n\nThe property also enjoys an excellent South Mayo location within easy reach of the wider Lake District.\n\nVIEWING\n\nA charming restored country residence in a highly regarded location close to Ballinrobe.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and strictly by appointment with the Sole Selling Agents.\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers\n\nNigel Dineen MIPAV MMCEPI\n086 213 0723\n\nOffice\n094 936 2216\n\nSOLE SELLING AGENT\n\nEverything We Touch Turns to SOLD.\n\nDISCLAIMER:\nThese particulars are issued for guidance purposes only and do not form part of any contract. Areas, measurements and distances are approximate. Intending purchasers should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all information, boundaries, services and other matters relating to the property.",
